{"title": "Spider Fall", "pageid": 50516, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spider_Fall", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Slow_Fall.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp/300px-Slow_Fall.webp, /w/images/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp/300px-Slow_Fall.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Slow_Fall.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Spider Fall</b> is a passive feature available to druids using the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Spider\" title=\"Giant Spider\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Giant_Spider.png/25px-Portrait_Giant_Spider.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Giant_Spider.png/38px-Portrait_Giant_Spider.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Giant_Spider.png/50px-Portrait_Giant_Spider.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Giant Spider\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/be/Portrait_Giant_Spider.png/25px-Portrait_Giant_Spider.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/be/Portrait_Giant_Spider.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Spider\" title=\"Giant Spider\">Giant Spider</a> wild shape.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>A network of spider silk slows the spider's fall, making it Resistant to Falling damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Giant_Spider\" title=\"Giant Spider\">Giant Spider</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slow_Fall\" title=\"Slow Fall\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Slow_Fall_Icon.webp/25px-Slow_Fall_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Slow_Fall_Icon.webp/38px-Slow_Fall_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Slow_Fall_Icon.webp/50px-Slow_Fall_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slow Fall\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Slow_Fall_Icon.webp/25px-Slow_Fall_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Slow_Fall_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slow_Fall\" title=\"Slow Fall\">Slow Fall</a> except it is always active.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714185606\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 929/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4958/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2467/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 139/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643638/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,cal